  2039	    """A row pooled over more than one source (§14 A1.4): per K the TABLE_KEYS stats over its points, and every
  2040	    point's provenance (campaign, pin, backend) -- descriptive pooling, never a Tier 2 / Tier 3 pairing."""
  2041	    return dict(_seed_stats({k: [p["metrics"] for p in pts] for k, pts in points.items()}, source),
  2042	                points={str(k): [{f: p[f] for f in POINT_FIELDS} for p in pts] for k, pts in points.items()})
